WEBVTT

01:30.850 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.080 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 30]

01:40.640 --> 01:42.240
They all say that these days,

01:42.560 --> 01:44.229
you've been frequenting the brothels
along the Qinhuai River.

01:44.229 --> 01:45.360
I didn't believe it.

01:45.870 --> 01:48.070
Of course, you shouldn't have believed it.

01:48.070 --> 01:48.930
Did you do that?

01:50.710 --> 01:52.070
I went for one day.

01:53.039 --> 01:54.000
If I tell you

01:54.039 --> 01:54.950
I was there on official business,

01:54.950 --> 01:56.150
would you believe me?

01:56.280 --> 01:57.810
Do you believe it yourself?

01:59.560 --> 02:00.890
It's a bit complicated.

02:00.920 --> 02:01.430
Yes.

02:02.430 --> 02:03.870
At first, I didn't believe it either,

02:03.870 --> 02:04.950
but then all these people

02:04.950 --> 02:06.760
from the brothels showed up at our home.

02:06.760 --> 02:07.400
I wished there was a crack in the ground

02:07.400 --> 02:08.729
I could disappear into.

02:08.750 --> 02:10.030
Mother told us not to speak to you.

02:10.030 --> 02:10.680
You know me.

02:10.680 --> 02:12.150
I'm not that kind of person at all.

02:12.150 --> 02:13.070
They said

02:13.560 --> 02:15.470
you visited more than 10 brothels
in a row.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.120
I didn't.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.460
You didn't?

02:18.430 --> 02:19.090
Maybe 5 or 6.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.400
They said
you were drinking with courtesans

02:20.400 --> 02:21.120
until you were completely drunk.

02:21.120 --> 02:21.650
I wasn't.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.710
You weren't?

02:24.120 --> 02:25.650
I wasn't completely drunk.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.870
They said you wrote an elegiac couplet

02:27.870 --> 02:29.520
for a famous courtesan who just died.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.079
I didn't.

02:30.120 --> 02:30.800
You didn't?

02:30.840 --> 02:31.910
His Excellency wrote it.

02:31.910 --> 02:32.310
You...

02:32.840 --> 02:34.500
You've made Mother so angry.

02:34.560 --> 02:36.310
She said
you've become a beast with no morals!

02:36.310 --> 02:37.310
What kind of talk is that?

02:37.310 --> 02:38.329
How am I a beast?

02:38.430 --> 02:40.630
Can you please listen to my explanation?

02:40.630 --> 02:41.710
When I say I was on official business,

02:41.710 --> 02:42.620
I mean it!

02:42.710 --> 02:43.840
The way of pen and sword demands

02:43.840 --> 02:44.800
a balance between tension and relaxation!

02:44.800 --> 02:45.329
Besides,

02:45.430 --> 02:46.590
visiting courtesans

02:46.590 --> 02:48.320
is a common thing for a real man.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.150
Say that again.

02:51.190 --> 02:52.590
Where did you learn that?

02:52.590 --> 02:53.520
I was confused in my anger.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.870
The brothel madam said it.

02:54.870 --> 02:55.430
Is that what you

02:55.430 --> 02:56.230
really think?

02:56.560 --> 02:57.140
No.

02:58.150 --> 02:58.710
Yu'er,

02:58.800 --> 03:00.400
I think I've twisted my back.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.430
Help me up.

03:01.750 --> 03:02.960
Are you trying to murder your own husband?

03:02.960 --> 03:04.090
You hit way too hard.

03:04.560 --> 03:04.910
I...

03:05.080 --> 03:06.240
I didn't push hard. Are you hurt?

03:06.240 --> 03:06.630
Let me see.

03:06.630 --> 03:07.490
Just down here.

03:08.400 --> 03:09.560
You... You...

03:09.910 --> 03:10.360
You...

03:10.840 --> 03:11.430
You...

03:14.470 --> 03:16.120
Alright, listen to my explanation.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.560
Nanjing is so desolate now.

03:17.560 --> 03:20.020
I need to revitalize the Qinhuai River
first

03:20.190 --> 03:21.490
to attract merchants.

03:21.680 --> 03:23.010
These are just tactics.

03:23.150 --> 03:24.079
Why don't you mention that His Excellency

03:24.079 --> 03:24.840
also went there?

03:24.840 --> 03:26.520
He's even a Neo-Confucian scholar.

03:26.520 --> 03:27.780
Don't be angry with me.

03:28.310 --> 03:29.400
That's all explained?

03:29.400 --> 03:30.660
That's all explained.

03:30.840 --> 03:32.960
What's there to explain?

03:32.980 --> 03:34.840
-Cheating, huh?
-Blow the light and go to bed.

03:34.840 --> 03:35.440
Pingyuan.

03:39.840 --> 03:41.040
Mother wants you both

03:41.470 --> 03:42.400
to stop arguing.

03:50.910 --> 03:51.710
Pingwen.

03:53.060 --> 03:53.960
Is my bedroom

03:54.000 --> 03:56.200
a place you can enter whenever you want?

03:56.240 --> 03:57.680
I just came to the rescue.

03:57.750 --> 03:59.150
Mother was afraid you might fight.

03:59.150 --> 03:59.960
Fight?

04:02.310 --> 04:03.930
You think Yu'er is like you?

04:04.080 --> 04:05.240
She's understanding.

04:05.240 --> 04:05.800
Yu'er and I

04:05.800 --> 04:07.520
couldn't possibly have
any misunderstanding.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.870
Do I need to explain anything to her?

04:08.870 --> 04:10.300
Unlike you who jump at every chance...

04:10.300 --> 04:11.470
You're sleeping outside tonight.

04:11.470 --> 04:13.280
Don't let Mother think I'm a pushover.

04:13.280 --> 04:13.740
Get out.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.750
No meat today.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.560
Is Mr. Gu in?

04:57.750 --> 04:58.360
I'm...

04:58.920 --> 04:59.480
Come in.

05:05.000 --> 05:06.630
I am Sun Er, Acting County Magistrate,

05:06.630 --> 05:08.160
paying my respects to you, Mr. Gu.

05:08.160 --> 05:08.720
No need for such formalities

05:08.720 --> 05:09.800
when we're at home.

05:10.120 --> 05:10.750
Have you eaten yet?

05:10.750 --> 05:11.270
Join us.

05:11.950 --> 05:13.750
Thank you for your kindness, Mr. Gu.

05:13.750 --> 05:14.880
I've already eaten.

05:15.310 --> 05:17.310
Mr. Gu, I'm here for your instructions.

05:17.310 --> 05:19.040
Official business so early in the morning?

05:19.040 --> 05:20.170
His Excellency said

05:20.310 --> 05:21.800
that he was aware of the gifts

05:21.800 --> 05:22.840
from the Qinhuai River yesterday,

05:22.840 --> 05:24.240
which are not considered a bribe.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.040
He asked you
to accept them without concern.

05:26.040 --> 05:26.750
He'll be responsible

05:26.750 --> 05:27.950
if anything happens.

05:29.750 --> 05:30.680
I was wondering.

05:30.730 --> 05:31.920
I was wondering why last night

05:31.920 --> 05:33.650
so many people came to my house.

05:33.960 --> 05:34.970
So those gifts

05:35.000 --> 05:37.730
were meant
for the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

05:38.630 --> 05:39.830
That was the original plan.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.159
But His Excellency said

05:41.190 --> 05:42.680
the Qinhuai River
revitalization initiative

05:42.680 --> 05:44.480
was your idea,

05:44.600 --> 05:46.159
so he can't accept the gifts.

05:46.159 --> 05:47.000
His Excellency

05:47.000 --> 05:48.400
truly has a broad mind

05:48.480 --> 05:49.600
and a noble character.

05:49.600 --> 05:51.560
Mr. Gu, you're incredibly resourceful,

05:51.560 --> 05:52.010
well,

05:52.120 --> 05:53.780
even surpassing Zhuge Liang.

05:54.310 --> 05:55.070
His Excellency

05:55.070 --> 05:56.070
specifically mentioned

05:56.070 --> 05:57.720
that he is a disciple of Confucius,

05:57.720 --> 05:58.600
and you are

05:58.750 --> 06:00.160
a disciple of Master Guan Zhong.

06:00.160 --> 06:02.290
Please accept them with peace of mind.

06:02.800 --> 06:04.000
He's messing with me.

06:05.290 --> 06:06.040
His Excellency

06:06.040 --> 06:07.190
has prepared the elegiac couplet

06:07.190 --> 06:08.390
for the madam already

06:08.430 --> 06:09.730
and some gifts as well.

06:09.920 --> 06:11.390
Today we'd like you

06:11.430 --> 06:12.870
to represent
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

06:12.870 --> 06:14.560
on a visit to the Qinhuai River.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.160
Oh, right.

06:15.400 --> 06:16.870
He can't go himself.

06:17.630 --> 06:19.700
So I need your instructions—

06:19.800 --> 06:22.690
shall we go by boat or by sedan chair?

06:23.560 --> 06:24.190
Let's take a boat.

06:24.190 --> 06:25.160
It's more discreet.

06:25.160 --> 06:25.570
Yes.

06:25.800 --> 06:26.830
I'll be waiting outside

06:26.830 --> 06:27.830
to accompany you.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.160
Good.

06:38.600 --> 06:40.430
Mother, are you still mad at me?

06:41.720 --> 06:43.040
Do you think your son is the type

06:43.040 --> 06:43.680
who would put on official robes

06:43.680 --> 06:45.080
and then visit brothels?

06:45.360 --> 06:46.020
Or is it that

06:46.800 --> 06:49.460
you're afraid
Yu'er will be taken advantage of?

06:50.950 --> 06:51.550
Mr. Chang.

06:52.480 --> 06:54.240
We have a friendship
that runs deeper than blood.

06:54.240 --> 06:55.500
You can't not trust me.

06:56.220 --> 06:57.360
Stop taking Mr. Liao

06:57.390 --> 06:58.740
to practice your inner strength.

06:58.740 --> 07:00.400
Sit down and let me talk to you.

07:02.310 --> 07:04.190
I do trust you.

07:05.430 --> 07:06.690
But Yu'er told me

07:06.870 --> 07:08.240
that last night you said,

07:08.240 --> 07:09.500
"Visiting courtesans

07:09.510 --> 07:11.950
is a common thing for a real man."

07:13.410 --> 07:14.830
I said so many

07:14.870 --> 07:16.120
righteous things last night.

07:16.120 --> 07:17.430
Why did you only tell Mr. Chang

07:17.430 --> 07:18.380
this one sentence?

07:18.380 --> 07:19.640
Did he really say that?

07:20.540 --> 07:21.240
If you don't speak up,

07:21.240 --> 07:22.900
no one will think you're mute.

07:23.990 --> 07:25.990
A grown son makes his own decisions.

07:27.000 --> 07:27.660
No, Mother,

07:28.390 --> 07:29.850
you talk, and I'll listen.

07:30.630 --> 07:33.290
Although you don't hold
any official position,

07:33.600 --> 07:34.240
we are now

07:34.270 --> 07:36.430
staying at
the Viceroy of Liangjiang's post station.

07:36.430 --> 07:37.510
All of this is true.

07:37.950 --> 07:39.230
I don't know many characters,

07:39.230 --> 07:41.409
but I've lived long enough

07:41.830 --> 07:42.870
to have learned

07:42.920 --> 07:44.320
a thing or two about life.

07:44.510 --> 07:45.840
Look at the opera stage.

07:46.870 --> 07:48.800
Those little spirits and soldiers

07:49.120 --> 07:50.950
doing somersaults and handstands

07:50.950 --> 07:52.080
put on a lively show.

07:52.950 --> 07:54.240
But look again,

07:55.390 --> 07:56.860
the emperor,

07:57.120 --> 07:57.830
the prime minister,

07:57.830 --> 07:58.490
and the generals on stage.

07:58.490 --> 07:59.480
Which one of them is doing somersaults

07:59.480 --> 08:00.480
or handstands?

08:01.480 --> 08:02.940
There's a principle here.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.520
What clothes you wear

08:05.630 --> 08:06.750
and what position you hold

08:06.750 --> 08:08.560
determine what you should do.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.830
If you can't understand
even this basic point,

08:12.830 --> 08:15.030
you seem not to value your life anymore.

08:16.800 --> 08:17.270
Yes.

08:17.950 --> 08:18.830
You're right.

08:19.390 --> 08:19.950
I know.

08:20.310 --> 08:21.480
You're not a fool.

08:22.040 --> 08:24.070
You wouldn't start drinking
and visiting brothels

08:24.070 --> 08:25.930
as soon as you set foot in Nanjing.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.370
I don't believe it.

08:28.430 --> 08:30.290
Yu'er doesn't believe it either.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.630
What do the viceroys

08:34.360 --> 08:35.330
want from you?

08:35.720 --> 08:37.320
What do they see in you?

08:38.270 --> 08:40.120
Simply that you have no backing,

08:40.240 --> 08:41.370
and you have talent.

08:41.440 --> 08:43.320
So they can use you as their tool.

08:44.030 --> 08:45.890
But they are real high officials.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.870
Even if you help them make Nanjing

08:47.870 --> 08:49.790
prosperous and magnificent,

08:50.120 --> 08:51.960
if just one person says

08:53.480 --> 08:54.840
that they, as high officials,

08:54.840 --> 08:56.330
drink and visit brothels,

08:56.910 --> 08:58.640
and if the emperor blames them,

08:59.110 --> 09:00.360
they'll need to find a scapegoat

09:00.360 --> 09:01.510
to deal with the situation.

09:01.510 --> 09:03.110
Which scapegoat do you think

09:03.150 --> 09:04.880
would be the most suitable one?

09:08.840 --> 09:11.100
Then that would be so despicable of them.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.470
Pingyuan,

09:14.240 --> 09:15.800
I'll just say one thing.

09:16.440 --> 09:19.120
Your mother's wisdom far exceeds yours.

09:23.630 --> 09:24.790
Last night,

09:24.840 --> 09:26.900
Mr. Chang and I couldn't sleep at all.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.540
We were tossing and turning in bed,

09:29.600 --> 09:32.030
trying to figure out
how to get you out of this mess.

09:32.030 --> 09:32.720
I know.

09:32.910 --> 09:34.370
You want to save the world,

09:34.600 --> 09:36.760
but you can't even save yourself.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.630
Who do you think you can possibly save?

09:38.630 --> 09:40.230
You've dragged us into this.

09:40.320 --> 09:42.580
You've made your mother sick with worry.

09:43.120 --> 09:44.520
Aren't these your fault?

09:47.120 --> 09:48.580
I didn't think it through.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.260
Mother, you're right.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.440
You always

09:52.720 --> 09:54.240
rush headlong into things,

09:54.240 --> 09:56.570
with that stubborn personality of yours.

09:56.750 --> 09:57.950
If you harm yourself,

09:58.440 --> 09:59.480
you'll end up dragging Yu'er

09:59.480 --> 10:00.340
down with you.

10:00.510 --> 10:01.710
How could I bear that?

10:03.150 --> 10:03.900
Mother,

10:04.120 --> 10:05.380
you're so farsighted.

10:05.480 --> 10:06.120
You

10:06.750 --> 10:08.210
don't need to be so modest.

10:08.910 --> 10:10.270
Such a brilliant plan

10:10.630 --> 10:11.670
is something

10:11.960 --> 10:14.090
few people in this world could devise.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.200
However, these tactics

10:16.230 --> 10:17.910
may work in business,

10:18.670 --> 10:20.380
but in the official circles,

10:20.670 --> 10:22.200
they're far too dangerous.

10:22.550 --> 10:23.120
You are

10:23.150 --> 10:24.510
too conspicuous.

10:25.000 --> 10:27.120
As they say, the nail that sticks out
gets hammered down.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.660
When the time truly comes

10:29.000 --> 10:30.000
for execution,

10:30.600 --> 10:32.600
exile, or confiscation of property,

10:32.600 --> 10:34.330
it will be too late for regrets.

10:36.360 --> 10:38.390
Stop frightening him.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.530
Go about your business.

10:41.790 --> 10:43.910
Be it beheading, exile,
or property confiscation,

10:43.910 --> 10:44.840
I'll be with you.

10:44.890 --> 10:45.910
If you restrict him

10:45.910 --> 10:46.840
from making any move,

10:46.840 --> 10:47.750
he'll just stay at home every day

10:47.750 --> 10:48.600
watching me embroider.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.530
I won't stand it.

10:50.200 --> 10:51.350
It's a good thing

10:51.750 --> 10:52.480
he knows now.

10:58.020 --> 11:02.160
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

11:03.150 --> 11:05.200
These are banknotes
from the Four Major Banks.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.460
They have no markings.

11:06.480 --> 11:07.670
Each is worth 10,000 taels.

11:07.670 --> 11:09.200
They can be cashed anywhere.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.580
200,000 taels in total.

11:10.910 --> 11:12.200
Please accept them.

11:13.840 --> 11:14.700
My good nephew,

11:15.360 --> 11:16.490
this money

11:16.670 --> 11:18.360
is truly a great help to me.

11:21.350 --> 11:22.610
This money is nothing.

11:23.120 --> 11:23.870
If it can solve

11:23.870 --> 11:25.390
your urgent problem,

11:25.790 --> 11:27.600
I will feel much relieved.

11:28.750 --> 11:29.720
And my matter

11:30.150 --> 11:32.210
will naturally be easier to resolve.

11:35.630 --> 11:37.750
Today, I've received
from benevolent merchant Li Qin

11:37.750 --> 11:38.720
a donation of

11:39.150 --> 11:40.480
200,000 taels of silver.

11:40.480 --> 11:42.550
This is the receipt
from the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

11:41.660 --> 11:44.980
[Donated by Jiangning]

11:43.000 --> 11:44.460
It bears my official seal.

11:44.600 --> 11:46.390
When I report to His Highness,

11:46.840 --> 11:49.040
there will surely be imperial rewards.

11:49.240 --> 11:50.670
For rebuilding Nanjing,

11:51.030 --> 11:52.960
all merchants who donate

11:53.120 --> 11:54.630
will have their names
carved on stone tablets

11:54.630 --> 11:57.150
placed at the entrance
of the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

11:57.150 --> 11:59.050
This is an enormous merit indeed.

11:59.320 --> 11:59.880
Uncle,

11:59.960 --> 12:00.910
my father instructed

12:00.910 --> 12:02.910
that no receipt
is necessary for this money.

12:02.910 --> 12:03.700
No, no.

12:03.870 --> 12:05.670
This is money for Nanjing.

12:14.790 --> 12:15.770
Uncle,

12:16.600 --> 12:17.930
you truly are

12:17.960 --> 12:19.440
the renowned Neo-Confucian master,

12:19.440 --> 12:20.900
as clean and pure as water,

12:21.360 --> 12:22.960
with impeccable integrity.

12:23.870 --> 12:25.070
I admire you greatly.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.510
As clean and pure as water,

12:27.510 --> 12:29.110
with impeccable integrity?

12:29.790 --> 12:30.720
I'm not so sure.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.290
When you say these things,

12:32.290 --> 12:34.080
you must mean what you say.

12:34.510 --> 12:35.670
I speak these words

12:35.750 --> 12:36.810
not to flatter you.

12:37.150 --> 12:38.410
I hope you understand.

12:39.080 --> 12:40.130
A few days ago,

12:40.360 --> 12:42.120
I heard you went with that brother

12:42.120 --> 12:43.320
of mine, surnamed Gu,

12:43.750 --> 12:45.840
to drink by the Qinhuai River.

12:47.240 --> 12:49.270
You've devoted your life
to Neo-Confucianism,

12:49.270 --> 12:51.270
yet could tarnish your reputation.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.850
I'm sure the imperial court

12:54.480 --> 12:56.600
will understand your difficulties.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.050
I never expected

13:00.270 --> 13:01.600
that Li Million would have

13:01.600 --> 13:03.080
such a fine son.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.150
I'm truly envious.

13:06.080 --> 13:08.210
You're certainly no ordinary person.

13:08.360 --> 13:10.390
You've seen these little schemes of mine

13:10.390 --> 13:12.280
through quite clearly.

13:12.390 --> 13:13.170
Not at all.

13:13.480 --> 13:15.790
Uncle, you are half a sage.

13:17.510 --> 13:18.600
Until death,

13:18.630 --> 13:20.690
I must practice virtue with caution.

13:20.720 --> 13:21.670
Do you think

13:22.080 --> 13:23.720
being a sage is so easy?

13:24.390 --> 13:25.200
I understand.

13:25.390 --> 13:27.320
I'm very cautious myself.

13:27.630 --> 13:29.320
About my matter...

13:33.120 --> 13:34.120
In Nanjing now,

13:34.150 --> 13:35.720
nothing can be done.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.680
The army can't be disbanded.

13:37.750 --> 13:39.740
The soldiers become disgruntled,

13:39.960 --> 13:41.480
and discipline breaks down.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.620
If trouble breaks out someday,

13:43.720 --> 13:45.180
that would be disastrous.

13:45.270 --> 13:46.550
Years of hard work

13:47.120 --> 13:48.720
will be ruined in an instant.

13:49.000 --> 13:49.480
Uncle,

13:50.270 --> 13:52.270
there's already a solution at hand.

13:52.870 --> 13:53.320
Look.

13:53.550 --> 13:54.270
These

13:54.360 --> 13:56.270
are the title deeds for salt fields

13:56.270 --> 13:57.440
and management rights to salt stores,

13:56.330 --> 13:59.130
[Tax Receipt]

13:57.480 --> 13:58.290
mortgaged or sold

13:58.290 --> 13:59.220
to my father,

13:59.270 --> 14:00.670
when he was doing business with others.

14:00.670 --> 14:01.850
[Li Million shall have
10 and a half shares.]

14:01.240 --> 14:02.550
Now that peace has returned,

14:02.550 --> 14:03.550
you should give us instructions

14:03.550 --> 14:05.080
on how to proceed with them.

14:05.150 --> 14:06.550
I'll follow your orders.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.240
If this matter is settled,

14:08.240 --> 14:10.100
that small amount of money for you

14:10.240 --> 14:11.500
is certainly nothing.

14:14.970 --> 14:17.110
Can Li Million handle

14:17.720 --> 14:19.000
all these businesses?

14:19.320 --> 14:20.480
Doesn't he find it exhausting?

14:20.480 --> 14:22.340
When my father's business grows,

14:22.480 --> 14:23.910
helping you with your affairs

14:23.910 --> 14:25.770
will make us stand even stronger.

14:26.630 --> 14:28.360
Merchants stabilize the realm

14:28.840 --> 14:31.100
by only using gold and silver as weapons,

14:32.270 --> 14:34.330
nothing compared to your dominance.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.720
Your Excellency.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.120
Your Excellency.

14:50.790 --> 14:52.450
Where did you go this morning?

14:52.630 --> 14:54.690
I just delivered an elegiac couplet.

14:54.790 --> 14:55.990
At the madam's grave,

14:56.320 --> 14:57.050
I cried a bit.

14:57.200 --> 14:58.200
You didn't even know her.

14:58.200 --> 14:59.660
How could you possibly cry?

14:59.660 --> 15:00.960
Well, Your Excellency,
you wrote the elegiac couplet.

15:00.960 --> 15:01.870
I just shed a few tears.

15:01.870 --> 15:04.000
Consider it a complimentary service.

15:04.030 --> 15:04.790
Besides,

15:05.080 --> 15:06.720
I was genuinely moved.

15:06.750 --> 15:07.830
Moved by what?

15:08.670 --> 15:10.150
She was old enough

15:10.200 --> 15:11.510
to be your mother.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.000
You're so kind

15:14.120 --> 15:15.630
to give me all the credit.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.150
Yesterday,

15:17.170 --> 15:18.200
half the girls from the brothels

15:18.200 --> 15:19.480
all rushed to my house.

15:19.910 --> 15:21.310
It made my mother so angry

15:21.320 --> 15:22.940
that she told everyone to ignore me.

15:22.940 --> 15:23.870
My wife directly

15:23.870 --> 15:26.080
banished me to sleep
in the hall for the night.

15:26.080 --> 15:27.080
I'm toiling for our country,

15:27.080 --> 15:27.720
which is one thing,

15:27.720 --> 15:29.580
but to end up with such a result...

15:30.030 --> 15:30.720
When I think about it,

15:30.720 --> 15:32.200
I feel so wronged.

15:34.140 --> 15:35.520
You set me up,

15:35.670 --> 15:37.080
so I had to get back at you.

15:37.670 --> 15:38.320
Alright,

15:38.340 --> 15:39.810
I'll write a letter soon

15:39.840 --> 15:41.000
to explain everything clearly.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.340
I'll tell your mother

15:42.440 --> 15:43.600
it was official business.

15:43.600 --> 15:45.460
Don't feel wronged because of me.

15:46.080 --> 15:47.670
But my mother also said

15:48.710 --> 15:50.600
if it's truly for the benefit
of Jiangnan's people,

15:50.600 --> 15:51.860
then it's acceptable.

15:53.270 --> 15:54.210
As long as you

15:54.510 --> 15:56.240
can ensure my family's safety,

15:56.480 --> 15:58.600
I'm willing to sacrifice myself completely

15:58.600 --> 15:59.800
without hesitation.

16:01.870 --> 16:02.840
Of course.

16:03.910 --> 16:05.050
Confucius said,

16:05.080 --> 16:08.410
"How do we know the future
won't be better than the present?"

16:15.600 --> 16:16.460
[1,000 taels]

16:17.870 --> 16:18.600
Li Qin

16:18.870 --> 16:20.720
has delivered 200,000 taels of silver.

16:20.720 --> 16:21.630
I'm thinking

16:21.960 --> 16:23.270
of allocating 100,000 taels

16:23.270 --> 16:24.670
to the Jinling Publishing House

16:24.670 --> 16:26.360
to ensure the "Complete Library
of the Four Treasuries"

16:26.360 --> 16:27.560
is properly printed.

16:27.720 --> 16:29.390
As for the remaining 100,000 taels,

16:29.390 --> 16:30.510
I'll keep 30,000 to 50,000

16:30.510 --> 16:31.790
to renovate the Qinhuai River

16:31.790 --> 16:32.720
by widening the waterway,

16:32.720 --> 16:34.720
dredging it, and repairing buildings.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.240
The money that's left

16:36.320 --> 16:37.390
will be used to repair examination halls

16:37.390 --> 16:38.460
and fix roads.

16:39.030 --> 16:41.000
As you mentioned,
the way of pen and sword demands

16:41.000 --> 16:41.960
a balance between tension and relaxation.

16:41.960 --> 16:43.560
That's what it means, right?

16:43.870 --> 16:45.360
You're brilliant, Your Excellency.

16:45.360 --> 16:46.550
I'll definitely keep a close eye on

16:46.550 --> 16:47.570
the Jinling Publishing House.

16:47.570 --> 16:48.680
I plan to—

16:48.840 --> 16:49.510
Wait, wait.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.950
Don't try to avoid work.

16:52.080 --> 16:52.390
No,

16:52.390 --> 16:53.850
how is this avoiding work?

16:54.480 --> 16:55.550
Proofreading catalogs.

16:55.550 --> 16:56.480
Comparing editions.

16:56.480 --> 16:57.790
It's an important task.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.790
This isn't something you need to do.

16:59.870 --> 17:02.000
There are plenty of idle scholars around.

17:02.000 --> 17:03.200
Don't worry about it.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.069
Let me ask you.

17:04.069 --> 17:06.329
Do you understand salt administration?

17:07.270 --> 17:08.119
Not at all.

17:08.310 --> 17:09.810
You can learn if you don't.

17:10.240 --> 17:11.750
Before you came, I heard

17:12.270 --> 17:14.470
that you were excellent at selling tea.

17:14.880 --> 17:16.270
A master in that field.

17:16.680 --> 17:19.550
How hard could it be
to understand salt administration?

17:19.550 --> 17:20.859
This Li Million,

17:20.910 --> 17:22.680
using the military expense
reimbursement issue,

17:22.680 --> 17:24.010
wants me to support him.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.750
He spent several years

17:26.400 --> 17:27.349
and has actually managed

17:27.349 --> 17:28.920
to get all of Jiangnan's salt stores

17:28.920 --> 17:29.510
and salt fields

17:29.510 --> 17:31.200
under his control.

17:31.820 --> 17:32.790
He's forcing me

17:32.830 --> 17:33.570
to approve it.

17:33.570 --> 17:35.980
Isn't this equivalent
to putting all the nation's taxes

17:35.980 --> 17:36.640
into

17:36.680 --> 17:37.880
his hands?

17:38.880 --> 17:39.920
How dangerous!

17:41.100 --> 17:42.390
But this Li Million

17:42.590 --> 17:44.000
really has an eye for business.

17:44.000 --> 17:44.550
Impressive.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.550
Very impressive.

17:46.000 --> 17:46.550
Why?

17:47.480 --> 17:48.340
Are you scared?

17:51.680 --> 17:53.610
The state has always used salt licenses

17:53.610 --> 17:54.670
as monopoly rights

17:54.750 --> 17:56.640
given to salt merchants.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.160
They pay taxes every year.

17:59.790 --> 18:00.860
In the past,

18:00.920 --> 18:02.180
this was a good method.

18:02.590 --> 18:04.290
But after years of peace,

18:04.440 --> 18:07.160
these salt merchants
have become extremely greedy.

18:07.160 --> 18:09.030
They just appease the imperial court

18:09.030 --> 18:11.000
while raising prices as they please.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.310
In provinces affected by war,

18:12.310 --> 18:14.570
salt prices are higher than rice prices.

18:15.020 --> 18:15.820
In my opinion,

18:16.310 --> 18:17.640
we shouldn't hand these things

18:17.640 --> 18:18.310
over to him.

18:19.070 --> 18:21.750
The people's money
should be earned by the people.

18:21.750 --> 18:23.810
The state shouldn't create a monster

18:23.830 --> 18:25.760
that devours everything in sight.

18:31.440 --> 18:32.440
Your Excellency.

18:34.830 --> 18:36.160
If it's about capital

18:36.640 --> 18:37.310
or ability,

18:38.070 --> 18:39.070
I'm truly no match

18:39.070 --> 18:39.930
for Li Million.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.070
I appreciate your favor,

18:42.070 --> 18:43.070
but I really

18:44.310 --> 18:45.770
can't handle this matter.

18:46.830 --> 18:48.400
Desertion in the face of duty

18:48.400 --> 18:50.000
is punishable by death.

18:56.270 --> 18:57.030
I know

18:57.590 --> 18:59.320
you two are old acquaintances.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.500
If you handle this matter well for me,

19:03.230 --> 19:05.030
I'll grant you an official rank.

19:05.960 --> 19:06.420
Well...

19:08.160 --> 19:09.510
If you fail,

19:10.000 --> 19:11.800
military law will deal with you.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.300
[Righteous and Diligent]

19:24.400 --> 19:25.800
Please, no formalities.

19:28.200 --> 19:30.130
Let's go through things one by one.

19:31.020 --> 19:35.610
[Righteous and Diligent]

19:31.270 --> 19:31.960
Now,

19:32.000 --> 19:33.920
Westerners from over a dozen countries

19:33.920 --> 19:36.070
have sent official documents
to Liangjiang.

19:36.070 --> 19:36.720
First,

19:36.750 --> 19:39.000
they demand the restoration
of their churches.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.000
Second,

19:40.110 --> 19:42.320
they want to conduct business here.

19:42.640 --> 19:45.140
Ever since the "Treaty of Nanjing"
was signed,

19:45.140 --> 19:48.050
[Righteous and Diligent]

19:45.200 --> 19:48.060
all countries have demanded
equal trading rights.

19:48.600 --> 19:49.590
This is a massive change

19:49.590 --> 19:52.190
unprecedented
in our thousand-year history.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.770
No one knows

19:54.000 --> 19:55.000
what we should do.

19:56.310 --> 19:57.680
Which of you has experience

19:57.680 --> 19:58.740
in foreign affairs

19:59.240 --> 20:00.840
and can negotiate with them?

20:04.440 --> 20:05.440
Your Excellency.

20:05.550 --> 20:06.720
I'd like to try.

20:07.590 --> 20:08.440
Mr. Li.

20:09.590 --> 20:12.650
Your family has done business
with Westerners before.

20:12.790 --> 20:14.450
But Mr. Gu has experience too.

20:14.720 --> 20:16.000
Why don't you two

20:16.000 --> 20:17.350
take on this matter together,

20:17.350 --> 20:19.010
so you can support each other?

20:20.070 --> 20:20.350
Yes.

20:20.590 --> 20:20.980
Yes.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.480
The main principle lies in

20:27.790 --> 20:30.450
equal treatment
and upholding proper dignity.

20:31.440 --> 20:33.570
Please instruct me, Your Excellency.

20:34.350 --> 20:35.350
When dealing with them,

20:35.350 --> 20:36.880
you can't use that superior attitude

20:36.880 --> 20:37.830
of the Celestial Empire

20:37.830 --> 20:38.850
or be arrogant.

20:39.590 --> 20:41.880
Their ironclad warships and cannons

20:41.920 --> 20:43.120
are not just for show.

20:44.240 --> 20:46.020
But there's no need to fear them blindly.

20:46.020 --> 20:47.150
Reasonable matters

20:47.350 --> 20:48.960
must be handled properly.

20:50.350 --> 20:52.160
As for doing business...

20:53.400 --> 20:55.270
When trading in Liangjiang,

20:56.000 --> 20:57.060
I have just one rule

20:57.110 --> 20:58.040
for you

20:58.270 --> 20:59.310
that you must win;

21:00.400 --> 21:01.720
losing is not an option.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.510
Set boundaries for them.

21:04.200 --> 21:06.000
Don't let them do as they please.

21:06.200 --> 21:06.780
Li Qin,

21:06.830 --> 21:08.590
since you're an imperial court
candidate intendant,

21:08.590 --> 21:09.550
you should wear your official robes.

21:09.550 --> 21:09.920
Yes.

21:13.830 --> 21:18.130
[Righteous and Diligent]

21:14.790 --> 21:16.190
As for the second matter,

21:16.550 --> 21:18.440
the imperial court has issued an edict

21:18.440 --> 21:20.570
to restore the salt and iron monopoly.

21:21.200 --> 21:23.540
Most of the national tax revenue

21:23.680 --> 21:24.960
comes from salt administration.

21:24.960 --> 21:28.060
So we need to quickly calculate,

21:28.200 --> 21:29.530
in the Jiangnan region,

21:30.070 --> 21:32.470
whether these salt fields have title deeds

21:32.680 --> 21:34.720
and their owners are still alive

21:34.830 --> 21:36.760
and how many salt stores there are.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.790
Currently
in the Seven Provinces of Jiangnan,

21:38.790 --> 21:40.590
salt is more expensive than rice.

21:40.590 --> 21:42.520
This is absolutely unacceptable.

21:43.030 --> 21:44.230
Except for these two,

21:44.440 --> 21:46.880
the rest of you go immediately

21:46.960 --> 21:47.680
and form groups

21:47.680 --> 21:49.480
to investigate the situation

21:49.510 --> 21:50.480
in each province and county.

21:50.480 --> 21:52.940
Don't delay the imperial court's business.

21:53.070 --> 21:54.000
Yes.

21:55.730 --> 22:01.820
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

21:56.240 --> 21:57.000
The inn

21:57.030 --> 21:58.160
where you stay now

21:58.880 --> 22:00.160
has walls that are like glass.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.400
Who knows how many eyes

22:01.400 --> 22:02.400
are watching you?

22:07.400 --> 22:08.260
Do you realize?

22:08.640 --> 22:11.100
That old fox wants us
to fight like roosters.

22:11.440 --> 22:13.240
He wants us to fight to the death.

22:13.240 --> 22:14.510
And when we're both exhausted,

22:14.510 --> 22:15.350
he'll be even less likely

22:15.350 --> 22:16.810
to give up the salt fields.

22:18.240 --> 22:20.060
You have shops and title deeds,

22:20.290 --> 22:22.310
all purchased with your hard-earned money.

22:22.310 --> 22:23.570
What are you afraid of?

22:23.750 --> 22:24.920
If the imperial court were reasonable,

22:24.920 --> 22:25.790
I wouldn't be afraid at all.

22:25.790 --> 22:27.270
But the problem is they're not reasonable.

22:27.270 --> 22:28.530
These papers in my hand

22:28.880 --> 22:29.750
are no different

22:29.750 --> 22:30.880
from a pile of trash.

22:31.750 --> 22:32.590
This place

22:33.550 --> 22:34.880
is far too dangerous.

22:35.550 --> 22:37.810
You really shouldn't get involved here.

22:38.510 --> 22:39.570
You think I want to?

22:40.450 --> 22:42.450
He's brought my entire family here.

22:43.110 --> 22:44.480
I have no choice but to join in

22:44.480 --> 22:45.610
this cockfight now.

22:46.510 --> 22:48.000
We need to come up with a plan.

22:48.000 --> 22:49.310
We can't let that old man

22:49.310 --> 22:50.370
play us like fools.

22:52.350 --> 22:54.150
I hope you're telling the truth.

22:57.590 --> 22:58.200
Look,

22:58.920 --> 23:00.720
that old guy is quite something.

23:03.880 --> 23:06.400
We haven't even entered
the cockfighting arena yet,

23:06.400 --> 23:08.860
and we're already
suspicious of each other.

23:09.830 --> 23:10.360
Exactly.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.270
According to the "Treaty of Nanjing"

23:16.270 --> 23:17.790
and the "Treaty of Wangxia,"

23:17.790 --> 23:18.480
we believe

23:18.510 --> 23:20.550
that in an open commercial framework,

23:20.550 --> 23:22.790
all nations
should receive equal treatment.

23:22.790 --> 23:24.920
Currently, regarding commercial matters,

23:24.920 --> 23:26.790
there's no way
to further deepen our relationship.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.920
This would be a loss

23:28.160 --> 23:29.160
for both parties.

23:31.110 --> 23:32.350
What do you mean

23:32.400 --> 23:34.400
by going further, Your Excellency?

23:34.400 --> 23:36.590
What do you mean by going further?

23:37.440 --> 23:40.090
[British Envoy]

23:40.510 --> 23:42.440
In businesses such as silk, textile,

23:42.440 --> 23:43.420
tea,

23:43.590 --> 23:44.720
and medicinal herb,

23:44.750 --> 23:45.640
we are qualified

23:45.640 --> 23:46.720
and should be permitted

23:46.720 --> 23:49.120
to make independent investments in China.

23:49.160 --> 23:51.350
We want to establish
our own textile factories,

23:51.350 --> 23:51.790
banks,

23:52.030 --> 23:52.960
and pharmacies.

23:53.310 --> 23:54.000
Is that right?

23:54.000 --> 23:54.620
Yeah.

23:58.790 --> 24:00.590
As for independent investment,

24:00.960 --> 24:02.040
we don't have

24:02.070 --> 24:03.600
sufficient authority now.

24:04.000 --> 24:05.200
You may need to go

24:05.240 --> 24:07.440
to the Office of General Management
in the capital.

24:07.440 --> 24:08.480
In the Liangjiang area,

24:08.480 --> 24:10.030
no one dares to make a decision now.

24:10.030 --> 24:11.510
We have our own textile factories.

24:11.510 --> 24:12.240
In Jiangnan,

24:12.550 --> 24:14.000
we have many silk-reeling factories.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.880
They have textile factories.

24:16.030 --> 24:19.640
And there are many filature factories
in Jiangnan as well.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.200
Okay.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.240
Let me show you something, alright?

24:26.960 --> 24:27.620
Bring it up.

24:47.200 --> 24:49.730
Let me introduce this today.
This is my honor.

24:49.870 --> 24:50.640
Here,

24:50.680 --> 24:52.370
I'm honored to present

24:52.720 --> 24:53.480
the greatest invention

24:53.480 --> 24:54.510
in the world,

24:55.720 --> 24:56.850
the Spinning Jenny.

24:57.480 --> 24:58.720
It was invented in Lancashire, England

24:58.720 --> 25:00.160
by James Hargreaves

25:00.270 --> 25:01.930
and named after his daughter.

25:01.960 --> 25:02.880
It marks the magnificent beginning

25:02.880 --> 25:04.610
of the Industrial Revolution.

25:07.920 --> 25:09.070
This machine can simultaneously

25:09.070 --> 25:10.440
spin 80 spindles.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.510
After numerous modifications,

25:12.510 --> 25:14.030
it now runs on steam power.

25:16.310 --> 25:17.640
Well, we have this kind of machine

25:17.640 --> 25:19.510
working in 300 textile factories

25:19.750 --> 25:22.430
in Cape Town.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.790
Currently in Cape Town,

25:23.790 --> 25:25.650
there are 300 textile factories.

25:26.830 --> 25:28.610
It's not just a machine.

25:29.200 --> 25:30.300
It's a monster.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.340
Believe me,

25:31.520 --> 25:33.190
all the silk in China

25:33.360 --> 25:34.960
can't satisfy its appetite.

25:36.750 --> 25:38.430
The fabric it produces

25:38.640 --> 25:39.640
is high-density,

25:39.640 --> 25:40.440
inexpensive,

25:40.550 --> 25:41.410
and beautiful.

25:41.510 --> 25:42.370
Does that mean

25:42.440 --> 25:43.970
when this monster comes in,

25:44.510 --> 25:46.400
all silk workers
in the Seven Provinces of Jiangnan

25:46.400 --> 25:47.380
will starve?

25:51.440 --> 25:52.160
Okay.

25:52.830 --> 25:54.110
Don't have to worry about.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.590
We need a lot of workers.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.680
He says they can come

25:58.720 --> 25:59.520
to work for us.

25:59.790 --> 26:01.680
We also have pharmaceutical, printing,

26:01.680 --> 26:03.350
manufacturing, and metallurgy industries.

26:03.350 --> 26:04.720
We need a large workforce.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.850
This is outrageous!

26:06.830 --> 26:08.830
Is this what you call
a business negotiation?

26:08.830 --> 26:10.790
You claim you need business equality

26:10.790 --> 26:11.510
and free trade.

26:11.510 --> 26:12.640
What is this really?

26:13.070 --> 26:15.080
Destroying Chinese factories

26:15.350 --> 26:16.160
and buying Chinese people

26:16.160 --> 26:17.020
as cheap labor?

26:18.720 --> 26:20.720
Getting angry with them won't help.

26:21.250 --> 26:22.070
Viceroy's Office

26:22.070 --> 26:22.830
has no solution.

26:22.830 --> 26:24.200
That's why they passed the buck to us.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.660
If we just leave like this,

26:25.720 --> 26:26.880
will they have any solution?

26:26.880 --> 26:27.400
Okay.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.070
And what's your final word

26:30.110 --> 26:31.310
of this negotiation?

26:33.070 --> 26:35.160
Please give us

26:35.240 --> 26:36.030
a final answer.

26:36.030 --> 26:36.720
Because this

26:36.720 --> 26:38.120
is the last negotiation.

26:39.640 --> 26:41.570
I can give him an answer right away.

26:41.790 --> 26:43.520
But I need to confirm one thing.

26:43.590 --> 26:45.070
As for so-called equal opportunity,

26:45.070 --> 26:46.680
does it mean our merchants

26:46.960 --> 26:48.200
can be fully permitted

26:48.200 --> 26:50.350
to go to your country to do business?

26:50.440 --> 26:53.070
Since we have equal opportunities,

26:53.350 --> 26:54.310
does that mean

26:54.590 --> 26:56.240
they can also

26:56.270 --> 26:58.270
do business in your country as well?

26:59.750 --> 27:00.550
You're welcome

27:00.550 --> 27:01.200
in London,

27:01.240 --> 27:02.200
Washington,

27:02.270 --> 27:03.730
and the African colonies.

27:03.830 --> 27:05.440
He says you're welcome to go to London,

27:05.440 --> 27:06.170
Washington,

27:06.310 --> 27:07.030
and their colonies

27:07.030 --> 27:08.350
all over Africa.

27:08.960 --> 27:10.350
The opportunities are equal.

27:10.350 --> 27:12.100
God will always give money

27:12.160 --> 27:13.560
to the greediest people.

27:13.590 --> 27:15.590
Tell them to spare us this nonsense.

27:17.880 --> 27:19.340
No need to translate this.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.810
I want to clarify one more thing.

27:21.810 --> 27:22.790
What if these industries

27:22.790 --> 27:24.050
they want to operate in

27:24.310 --> 27:25.680
have no business opportunities left

27:25.680 --> 27:26.790
in our country?

27:32.470 --> 27:33.350
You are officials.

27:33.350 --> 27:35.210
You're not businesspeople then.

27:35.310 --> 27:35.940
He says

27:36.160 --> 27:38.240
you are officials, not merchants.

27:39.510 --> 27:40.160
Tell him

27:40.960 --> 27:42.240
these two people before him

27:42.240 --> 27:43.570
are not officials at all

27:43.920 --> 27:46.380
but genuine merchants
from the Qing Empire.

27:46.550 --> 27:48.130
The silk industry,

27:48.400 --> 27:49.510
the pharmaceutical industry,

27:49.510 --> 27:50.830
and the tea industry they want

27:50.830 --> 27:51.640
have no room

27:52.240 --> 27:53.000
for further investment

27:53.000 --> 27:54.270
in our country.

27:55.070 --> 27:56.920
Even if Jiangnan makes an exception,

27:56.920 --> 27:57.520
in the end,

27:59.070 --> 28:01.130
they'll still return empty-handed.

28:06.720 --> 28:07.920
You go ahead. Come on.

28:11.590 --> 28:12.960
I'm so angry at them,

28:13.000 --> 28:13.980
you know?

28:14.510 --> 28:16.370
Can this be called a negotiation?

28:16.670 --> 28:17.110
Isn't this just

28:17.110 --> 28:18.310
a routine notification to us?

28:18.310 --> 28:19.160
It's like a robber

28:19.160 --> 28:19.640
telling us

28:19.640 --> 28:21.070
if they can take some money to spend!

28:21.070 --> 28:22.270
Isn't that the point?

28:23.070 --> 28:23.400
I want to...

28:23.400 --> 28:24.800
I want to shoot them dead.

28:24.880 --> 28:25.350
Let's go. Let's go.

28:25.350 --> 28:25.830
Let's go back and discuss.

28:25.830 --> 28:26.790
No, help me walk.

28:28.030 --> 28:28.560
Let's go.

28:29.660 --> 28:33.390
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

28:30.270 --> 28:32.150
In the 22nd year
of the Daoguang reign (1842),

28:32.150 --> 28:33.920
the 13 Trading Houses were abolished.

28:33.920 --> 28:35.160
The country's doors were thrown open

28:35.160 --> 28:37.030
with Westerners rushing in for profit.

28:37.030 --> 28:39.310
Western merchants are backed by gunboats,

28:39.310 --> 28:41.910
like wolves wanting to devour
our Qing Empire.

28:42.000 --> 28:44.400
If these Westerners open their factories,

28:45.160 --> 28:46.880
all the weavers
in the Seven Provinces of Jiangnan

28:46.880 --> 28:47.920
will be ruined.

28:48.790 --> 28:50.030
They'll all have to go

28:50.070 --> 28:51.280
to their factories

28:51.590 --> 28:53.050
and become their slaves.

28:54.880 --> 28:56.070
With our large population,

28:56.070 --> 28:56.750
how could everyone willingly

28:56.750 --> 28:57.950
become their slaves?

28:58.920 --> 29:00.850
Have you seen these photos before?

29:01.440 --> 29:03.070
What's the point of
whether I've seen them or not?

29:03.070 --> 29:03.920
If these words are said

29:03.920 --> 29:05.640
to those officials in the capital,

29:05.640 --> 29:06.790
they'll definitely say,

29:06.790 --> 29:09.090
"You only value frivolous skills."

29:09.350 --> 29:10.360
Say more

29:10.790 --> 29:12.520
and you'll lose your position.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.190
Liangjiang

29:14.590 --> 29:17.110
is different from the imperial court,
after all.

29:17.110 --> 29:18.370
After all these years,

29:18.440 --> 29:19.970
nothing has changed at all.

29:20.200 --> 29:21.040
You're right.

29:22.270 --> 29:24.110
Those officials in the imperial court

29:24.110 --> 29:25.730
see no evil

29:26.000 --> 29:26.990
and hear no evil.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.480
Look at these viceroys in Jiangnan.

29:29.590 --> 29:31.050
Who would talk about this?

29:31.200 --> 29:34.260
They all stick to Neo-Confucianism
as it's the safest.

29:37.440 --> 29:38.500
I'm a businessman.

29:39.200 --> 29:40.130
The quickest way

29:40.680 --> 29:41.610
is to spend money

29:41.750 --> 29:42.810
to buy the machines

29:43.070 --> 29:44.270
and set up factories.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.740
At worst, I'll spend more money

29:45.740 --> 29:47.240
to hire foreign technicians

29:47.240 --> 29:47.900
to teach us.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.860
Don't say such things in my house.

29:55.400 --> 29:57.460
We still need to learn their methods.

29:57.590 --> 29:58.270
If one day,

29:58.310 --> 30:00.000
Westerners stop selling machines to us,

30:00.000 --> 30:01.030
what will we do then?

30:01.030 --> 30:03.070
This talk is getting more outrageous.

30:03.070 --> 30:04.670
If this reaches the capital,

30:05.270 --> 30:08.600
it'll cause more trouble
than my visit to the Qinhuai River.

30:09.310 --> 30:09.770
Report!

30:11.110 --> 30:11.790
Urgent report!

30:11.790 --> 30:12.920
There's a disaster!

30:13.900 --> 30:14.950
[Nantong coastal embankment breaches—
water floods, disaster worsens]

30:16.480 --> 30:17.020
Let's go.

30:17.270 --> 30:18.960
Has the County Magistrate
of Nantong Prefecture arrived?

30:18.960 --> 30:20.200
How many victims are there?

30:20.200 --> 30:21.660
Has there been any unrest?

30:30.000 --> 30:30.510
Lord Gu.

30:39.590 --> 30:40.510
Zhongdeng.

30:44.800 --> 30:46.100
You scared me to death!

30:46.590 --> 30:47.030
I thought

30:47.030 --> 30:48.360
a Westerner had come in.

30:48.440 --> 30:49.440
When I was in India,

30:49.440 --> 30:50.640
I found a British tailor

30:50.640 --> 30:51.770
to make this outfit.

30:52.400 --> 30:53.920
I only dare to wear it for fun.

30:53.920 --> 30:54.920
Just now outside,

30:55.030 --> 30:56.830
I scared everyone on the street.

30:56.960 --> 30:58.640
You've just returned from India?

30:58.640 --> 30:59.570
Come on, come in.

30:59.640 --> 31:00.480
Come inside and tell me

31:00.480 --> 31:01.200
about your experiences.

31:01.200 --> 31:01.960
I'm all ears.

31:02.070 --> 31:02.480
Why?

31:02.750 --> 31:03.440
Are you also planning to go abroad

31:03.440 --> 31:04.840
to do business with them?

31:05.070 --> 31:06.120
It's a long story.

31:06.350 --> 31:07.960
In short, the current situation

31:07.960 --> 31:09.290
is extremely critical.

31:17.270 --> 31:17.730
Master.

31:17.830 --> 31:19.550
The masters of the Four Major Banks
from the capital have arrived.

31:19.550 --> 31:20.440
Four Major Banks,

31:20.440 --> 31:22.240
such a prestigious name.

31:22.270 --> 31:22.830
What is it?

31:22.830 --> 31:24.460
You all came together?

31:24.510 --> 31:25.970
Without any prior notice.

31:27.480 --> 31:27.810
Come.

31:27.880 --> 31:29.010
Have a seat, please.

31:37.550 --> 31:38.310
Master Li.

31:38.750 --> 31:39.870
Thanks to you,

31:40.480 --> 31:41.510
our Four Major Banks

31:41.510 --> 31:43.040
are close to shutting down.

31:43.680 --> 31:46.080
Soon, the four of us will be unemployed

31:46.160 --> 31:48.550
and will have to beg you for a meal.

31:50.270 --> 31:52.400
A sum of money arrived

31:52.440 --> 31:54.000
at the Jiangnan Silk Merchant House
yesterday,

31:54.000 --> 31:55.930
which I've left untouched for now.

31:56.350 --> 31:57.550
Why didn't you use it?

31:58.160 --> 31:59.160
Don't you love

31:59.200 --> 32:00.960
exchanging it for British pounds?

32:00.960 --> 32:02.550
Just deposit it
in the Xianghe Trade House.

32:02.550 --> 32:04.750
I'll deposit it when I've saved enough.

32:06.790 --> 32:08.520
Third Brother, Third Brother.

32:08.750 --> 32:09.110
Come.

32:10.030 --> 32:10.400
Come.

32:10.590 --> 32:11.250
Have a seat.

32:13.110 --> 32:15.310
Since you've withdrawn all the silver,

32:15.310 --> 32:17.170
if the Four Major Banks collapse,

32:17.200 --> 32:19.330
who would dare to do business with you?

32:20.680 --> 32:22.030
You're all red-faced

32:22.070 --> 32:23.800
just because of the withdrawl?

32:26.270 --> 32:27.030
Come on, sit down.

32:27.030 --> 32:27.790
Please sit.

32:30.550 --> 32:31.150
Everyone.

32:32.400 --> 32:35.200
In the past,
power belonged to the imperial court.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.920
Back then,

32:37.040 --> 32:39.300
we could do business without any effort.

32:40.110 --> 32:42.110
But after so many years of war,

32:42.160 --> 32:42.960
do you still think

32:42.960 --> 32:44.750
the power remains with the imperial court?

32:44.750 --> 32:46.070
If you think that way,

32:46.920 --> 32:47.830
within 3 years,

32:49.030 --> 32:49.830
every one of you

32:49.830 --> 32:51.500
will have to pack up and leave.

32:52.070 --> 32:53.590
When I went over there and saw it,

32:53.590 --> 32:54.390
we had already

32:54.640 --> 32:56.440
been outflanked by Westerners.

32:57.750 --> 32:58.810
The Westerners...

33:00.720 --> 33:02.380
The Westerners in Darjeeling

33:02.720 --> 33:04.880
have planted hundreds of thousands
of acres of green tea.

33:04.880 --> 33:05.680
The seedlings

33:05.750 --> 33:07.000
were stolen from us.

33:07.920 --> 33:09.380
I was completely shocked.

33:09.740 --> 33:10.710
And over there,

33:11.070 --> 33:13.070
they don't care about pre-Qingming picking

33:13.070 --> 33:14.340
or roasting at all.

33:14.880 --> 33:16.230
They just dry fresh leaves

33:16.230 --> 33:16.850
in the sun

33:17.590 --> 33:19.050
and give them a quick bake.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.160
That's not so bad.

33:21.160 --> 33:22.890
What do you mean by "not so bad"?

33:23.000 --> 33:23.720
Do you know

33:24.200 --> 33:25.060
the Westerners

33:25.240 --> 33:27.150
brew tea with hot milk?

33:28.030 --> 33:29.090
They even add sugar

33:29.510 --> 33:30.440
and rose petals.

33:30.790 --> 33:32.170
It made my mouth so sour

33:32.200 --> 33:34.460
I couldn't even tell what I was drinking.

33:35.440 --> 33:35.920
But

33:36.960 --> 33:38.510
Indian tea is cheap

33:38.960 --> 33:40.350
and sold in large quantities.

33:40.350 --> 33:42.550
The Westerners prefer their products.

33:43.790 --> 33:44.590
If you ask me,

33:45.200 --> 33:46.730
we need to find another way.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.240
The war just ended,

33:48.880 --> 33:50.370
and the Westerners want
to take over the tea, silk,

33:50.370 --> 33:51.830
and medicine businesses.

33:52.790 --> 33:54.030
The Liangjiang government

33:54.030 --> 33:55.960
wants us to fight a commercial battle

33:55.960 --> 33:58.270
against Westerners
on Liangjiang territory.

33:58.270 --> 33:59.330
They say we must win

33:59.680 --> 34:00.540
and can't lose.

34:01.720 --> 34:03.350
What does that mean?

34:04.640 --> 34:05.640
What they are doing now

34:05.640 --> 34:07.680
is buying in bulk

34:08.230 --> 34:09.630
and driving prices down.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.070
Do you know?

34:12.510 --> 34:15.550
Today at the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office,

34:16.070 --> 34:17.110
I was looking through the accounts.

34:17.110 --> 34:18.310
Their foreign agents

34:18.400 --> 34:19.440
have bought up 70-80% of cocoons

34:19.440 --> 34:20.969
from Lianghu, Liangguang,

34:21.480 --> 34:23.010
and East and West Zhejiang.

34:23.880 --> 34:24.630
Do you understand

34:24.630 --> 34:25.690
what 70-80% means?

34:27.150 --> 34:27.840
So many.

34:28.710 --> 34:30.370
They're making such a big move

34:30.510 --> 34:32.110
just to set their own prices.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.150
If in the future,

34:34.440 --> 34:35.770
tea, silk, and medicine

34:36.100 --> 34:37.760
are all priced by Westerners,

34:38.230 --> 34:39.760
how is that any different

34:39.800 --> 34:42.260
from generals surrendering our territory?

34:43.120 --> 34:45.070
That's why I say we're in imminent danger.

34:45.070 --> 34:46.710
The crisis is upon us.

34:46.830 --> 34:48.420
This is no joking matter.

34:48.920 --> 34:49.840
You mean

34:50.550 --> 34:52.880
the imperial court is in imminent danger?

34:53.760 --> 34:55.090
It's the entire country

34:55.960 --> 34:57.490
that's in imminent danger.

35:00.960 --> 35:02.620
I hold no love for this regime,

35:04.110 --> 35:05.970
but my heart belongs to this land.

35:07.840 --> 35:09.400
Whenever I see

35:10.880 --> 35:12.480
those Westerners' spinning machines

35:12.480 --> 35:13.540
and steam engines,

35:14.630 --> 35:16.030
I feel deeply alarmed.

35:17.880 --> 35:19.610
One of their spinning machines

35:19.760 --> 35:21.360
is equal to 80 of our weavers.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.840
Their efficiency
is more than 10 times ours.

35:24.840 --> 35:26.300
Powered by steam engines,

35:27.150 --> 35:28.360
they can operate year-round,

35:28.360 --> 35:29.790
day and night without stopping.

35:29.790 --> 35:30.530
You know,

35:30.670 --> 35:33.070
for Westerners
to build factories in China,

35:33.070 --> 35:34.730
the costs are incredibly low.

35:35.630 --> 35:37.090
In the future, our workers

35:37.280 --> 35:37.880
will be

35:37.920 --> 35:38.710
slaves in their factories

35:38.710 --> 35:40.040
for their entire lives,

35:41.320 --> 35:42.030
or

35:43.150 --> 35:44.110
there will be

35:44.150 --> 35:45.610
an even greater disaster.

35:46.840 --> 35:48.770
This is just the textile industry.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.710
As for all the others,

35:51.630 --> 35:52.690
I dare not imagine.

35:54.320 --> 35:55.030
Mr. Gu,

35:56.150 --> 35:56.800
you truly haven't

35:56.800 --> 35:58.660
wasted your time in officialdom.

35:58.800 --> 36:01.840
Every word shows your concern
for our country and people.

36:01.840 --> 36:03.240
You make me feel ashamed.

36:06.150 --> 36:08.280
When I was growing tea in Anhui before,

36:08.590 --> 36:10.480
I was still fighting with the head
of the Tea Merchants' Association,

36:10.480 --> 36:11.920
squabbling among ourselves.

36:11.920 --> 36:12.840
Back then, I thought

36:12.840 --> 36:13.760
I was so clever.

36:14.110 --> 36:15.190
But when I went to Jiangning,

36:15.190 --> 36:16.030
in less than 10 days,

36:16.030 --> 36:17.550
I felt completely inadequate.

36:17.550 --> 36:18.880
The French, the British,

36:18.880 --> 36:19.880
and the Portuguese

36:19.880 --> 36:21.070
mobilize their entire nations

36:21.070 --> 36:22.330
to do business with us,

36:23.000 --> 36:25.030
using the most advanced technology,

36:25.030 --> 36:26.360
the finest weapons,

36:26.440 --> 36:28.040
and the toughest attitudes.

36:28.590 --> 36:29.590
What do they want?

36:29.880 --> 36:32.080
They want to hollow out the Qing Empire.

36:33.710 --> 36:34.710
And what about us?

36:34.840 --> 36:35.800
We're still in a daze,

36:35.800 --> 36:37.150
not taking them seriously,

36:37.150 --> 36:38.670
fantasizing the Qing Empire,

36:38.670 --> 36:39.880
and looking down on everything.

36:39.880 --> 36:41.030
There is no future.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.670
There are no draft banks anymore.

36:42.670 --> 36:44.230
And there's no Li Million anymore.

36:44.230 --> 36:45.640
Can't you see?

36:45.760 --> 36:47.690
They're now using guns and cannons

36:47.710 --> 36:49.170
to force us into business.

36:49.280 --> 36:50.820
Either we lose, or we win.

36:51.280 --> 36:52.230
There's no room

36:52.250 --> 36:53.980
for benevolence and morality.

36:56.270 --> 36:57.070
The Jiangnan region

36:57.070 --> 36:58.710
hasn't yet recovered its strength.

36:58.710 --> 37:00.770
There are many Westerners there too.

37:00.840 --> 37:02.840
Whether we can survive in the future

37:03.150 --> 37:06.480
depends on whether we can establish
ourselves in the south.

37:07.110 --> 37:08.550
I've taken over

37:08.590 --> 37:09.630
all the salt industry in Lianghuai.

37:09.630 --> 37:10.360
Next,

37:10.550 --> 37:11.630
I'll monopolize

37:11.760 --> 37:14.360
tea, silk,

37:14.400 --> 37:15.480
and medicinal materials.

37:15.480 --> 37:16.680
When that time comes,

37:17.000 --> 37:19.360
I'll need suppot
from the Four Major Banks.

37:19.360 --> 37:20.670
If you invest more,

37:20.760 --> 37:22.820
you'll get more profit in the future.

37:23.440 --> 37:25.550
Isn't it nice to count money at home?

37:27.710 --> 37:28.400
Master Li.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.180
How many salt fields

37:32.000 --> 37:33.510
have you acquired in Lianghuai?

37:33.510 --> 37:34.590
142.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.170
I've been quietly taking them over

37:38.170 --> 37:39.510
while having to guard against

37:39.510 --> 37:42.760
the viceroys and governors
of Liangjiang undermining me.

37:42.760 --> 37:45.220
In the future,
when I need to mobilize funds,

37:45.590 --> 37:46.320
my old friends,

37:46.320 --> 37:48.520
you'll need to continue supporting me.

37:49.400 --> 37:51.550
The Four Major Banks can support you.

37:52.030 --> 37:52.760
However,

37:53.630 --> 37:55.630
as for the profits from your salt fields,

37:55.630 --> 37:57.200
the Four Major Banks

37:57.480 --> 37:59.830
will take at least 30% in the future.

38:02.070 --> 38:03.800
Everyone's in it for the money.

38:04.400 --> 38:06.060
I think this deal works for me.

38:08.550 --> 38:09.110
Great.

38:13.320 --> 38:13.880
Mr. Li.

38:14.630 --> 38:15.890
We are just merchants.

38:16.070 --> 38:17.030
We can't make decisions

38:17.030 --> 38:18.360
for the imperial court.

38:19.150 --> 38:19.880
But I think

38:20.800 --> 38:21.480
at this moment,

38:21.480 --> 38:23.480
we can join forces to save the market

38:23.550 --> 38:25.230
and delay the Westerners' entry

38:25.230 --> 38:26.510
into the Qing Empire.

38:27.110 --> 38:28.310
As for other matters,

38:29.960 --> 38:31.290
we'll have to leave them

38:31.840 --> 38:33.170
to more capable people.

38:35.190 --> 38:35.760
Good.

38:36.760 --> 38:37.360
Great.

38:38.230 --> 38:40.630
When you decide to act,
we'll act together.

38:45.760 --> 38:46.230
Gu,

38:46.710 --> 38:47.800
why do I feel so uncomfortable

38:47.800 --> 38:48.800
in your house?

38:49.670 --> 38:50.070
I...

38:53.150 --> 38:54.810
I feel like I'm being watched.

39:03.710 --> 39:05.120
What are you all doing?

39:05.280 --> 39:05.960
If you want to look,

39:05.960 --> 39:07.420
come in and look properly.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.470
My friend Mr. Li

39:09.670 --> 39:10.550
has just returned from India

39:10.550 --> 39:11.670
after selling tea there.

39:11.670 --> 39:13.230
Are you not used to his appearance?

39:13.230 --> 39:15.030
I think he looks quite handsome.

39:16.510 --> 39:17.440
Fine, look then.

39:18.710 --> 39:19.710
What do you think?

39:20.190 --> 39:21.520
Isn't it quite special?

39:21.840 --> 39:23.330
Who would dress like this?

39:23.800 --> 39:25.730
Looks like a long-legged chicken.

39:26.550 --> 39:28.650
Westerners' knees don't bend.

39:28.770 --> 39:30.130
Hit them with a stick,

39:30.230 --> 39:31.320
and they fall to the ground.

39:31.320 --> 39:32.740
Who told you that, old man?

39:32.740 --> 39:33.550
Why are you wearing

39:33.550 --> 39:34.880
a spittoon on your head?

39:35.480 --> 39:36.230
Alright, that's enough.

39:36.230 --> 39:36.770
Move along, move along.

39:36.770 --> 39:37.590
Nothing to see here.

39:37.590 --> 39:39.120
Fine, everyone, disperse.

39:39.230 --> 39:40.490
I want one of those too.

39:42.670 --> 39:43.730
Go away, all of you.

39:44.920 --> 39:45.580
Mother,

39:45.670 --> 39:46.800
why are you here too?

39:47.280 --> 39:48.010
Old Madam Gu.

39:48.630 --> 39:49.360
You're here.

39:50.070 --> 39:51.270
Do you need anything?

39:52.710 --> 39:54.440
They were all gathered at the door.

39:54.440 --> 39:55.440
I didn't see that.

39:56.510 --> 39:57.280
I'm fine.

39:57.760 --> 39:59.160
Y-You continue talking.

40:05.000 --> 40:07.030
In recent years,
there's been fighting in the south.

40:07.030 --> 40:09.320
Rebels often take stones
from the coastal embankment

40:09.320 --> 40:11.070
to build their fortifications,

40:11.070 --> 40:14.000
causing severe damage to many sections
of the coastal embankment.

40:14.000 --> 40:15.600
With the treasury depleted,

40:15.630 --> 40:17.960
the coastal embankment
has gone unrepaired for years.

40:17.960 --> 40:21.000
I got reports yesterday—
Nantong's coastal embankment collapsed,

40:21.000 --> 40:22.320
causing countless casualties.

40:22.320 --> 40:24.190
We're currently calculating
the number of victims

40:24.190 --> 40:26.440
and the taels of silver and food

40:26.510 --> 40:27.630
needed for disaster relief.

40:27.630 --> 40:29.150
We can't count on

40:29.190 --> 40:30.320
the imperial court anymore.

40:30.320 --> 40:31.780
We need to find a solution.

40:37.510 --> 40:38.510
Your Excellency.

40:38.630 --> 40:40.630
The Li family is willing to help you.

40:41.440 --> 40:43.150
Before I came, my father instructed me

40:43.150 --> 40:45.080
to serve you in every way possible.

40:45.400 --> 40:46.330
If you agree,

40:46.760 --> 40:48.150
I can return to the capital immediately

40:48.150 --> 40:49.070
to raise funds

40:49.110 --> 40:51.000
to repair the coastal embankment.
What do you think?

40:51.000 --> 40:52.800
Your intentions are admirable.

40:53.670 --> 40:54.510
But there's one thing.

40:54.510 --> 40:57.000
I don't do business blindly.

40:57.840 --> 40:59.110
After repairing the coastal embankment,

40:59.110 --> 41:00.570
what do you want in return?

41:01.670 --> 41:03.800
I submitted a list to you.

41:04.800 --> 41:05.230
The list of over 140 salt fields

41:05.230 --> 41:06.960
in Jiangnan.

41:07.110 --> 41:08.920
If you can help me

41:08.960 --> 41:10.090
settle this matter,

41:10.550 --> 41:13.610
it'll be more convenient
to access funds in the future.

41:14.150 --> 41:15.350
Well, well.

41:15.630 --> 41:16.090
That...

41:16.190 --> 41:18.280
That's quite a blunt statement.

41:19.710 --> 41:21.550
Why would the salt fields and stores

41:21.550 --> 41:22.950
your Li family purchased

41:23.000 --> 41:25.480
require the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

41:25.670 --> 41:26.470
to intervene?

41:27.150 --> 41:28.660
For some,

41:28.710 --> 41:30.510
we can find the original owners.

41:30.960 --> 41:31.800
But there are others

41:31.800 --> 41:33.360
that have been seized

41:33.510 --> 41:34.710
by local bullies.

41:35.230 --> 41:35.960
And for some,

41:36.280 --> 41:37.880
we only have the title deeds,

41:38.110 --> 41:39.110
but the people who could claim them

41:39.110 --> 41:40.150
are all dead.

41:41.070 --> 41:41.940
My father said

41:42.000 --> 41:43.360
if the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

41:43.360 --> 41:45.240
could lend a hand to the Li family,

41:45.630 --> 41:47.960
we would certainly
do everything in our power

41:47.960 --> 41:49.630
to serve you in the future.

41:55.070 --> 41:56.870
Why aren't you saying anything?

41:56.920 --> 41:58.300
This isn't like you.

41:58.790 --> 41:59.280
Your Excellency,

41:59.280 --> 42:01.480
I know nothing about the salt business.

42:05.230 --> 42:07.630
The salt industry
is a government monopoly.

42:07.630 --> 42:08.630
If this power

42:08.670 --> 42:10.320
is placed in the hands of merchants,

42:10.320 --> 42:12.030
it will inevitably weaken
the court's authority,

42:12.030 --> 42:14.290
which is not good for the imperial court.

42:15.400 --> 42:16.510
How about this?

42:17.280 --> 42:19.360
Why don't you two

42:19.400 --> 42:20.840
both go repair the coastal embankment?

42:20.840 --> 42:21.950
Split it into east and west sections.

42:21.950 --> 42:23.550
Each of you repairs one part.

42:23.690 --> 42:25.320
Then I'll judge which is better.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.360
After the repairs are done,

42:26.360 --> 42:28.360
I'll request recognition
for your achievements

42:28.360 --> 42:30.960
and mention the salt field matter
in my report.

42:31.400 --> 42:33.400
If you win, Mr. Li,

42:33.550 --> 42:36.630
then the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office
will be duty-bound

42:36.630 --> 42:37.800
to step in

42:38.070 --> 42:39.760
and resolve this matter for you.

42:39.760 --> 42:40.760
Your Excellency,

42:41.030 --> 42:42.440
I don't understand
what repairing the embankment

42:42.440 --> 42:44.100
has to do with the salt fields.

42:44.230 --> 42:45.150
My good nephew,

42:45.550 --> 42:47.590
you have no idea how much pressure

42:47.630 --> 42:48.550
I'm under.

42:49.000 --> 42:50.480
Everyone thinks I've made

42:50.510 --> 42:52.400
a fortune in this position.

42:52.710 --> 42:53.960
If I were to oversee

42:54.000 --> 42:55.110
giving the Lianghuai salt business

42:55.110 --> 42:56.280
to your family,

42:57.150 --> 42:59.150
those memorials against me behind my back

42:59.150 --> 43:00.760
would be piled higher than the city walls.
